                "description": "Schlage B60ADD, Addison Single Cylinder Deadbolt - The Addison Single Cylinder Deadbolt is a stunning example of traditional design for the modern homeowner. Neither old-fashioned nor too contemporary, this front door lock is very now. It has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch. It is also adjustable for 1-3/8 inch up to 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses.",
